\f3\b0  remove exemplos da classe maiorit\'e1ria.\uc0\u8232 
\f11 \uc0\u10148 
\f3  Risco de perda de informa\'e7\'e3o.\
\ls8\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 SMOTE (Chawla et al., 2002):
\f3\b0  cria exemplos sint\'e9ticos interpolando casos minorit\'e1rios.\uc0\u8232 
\f11 \uc0\u10148 
\f3  Melhor que ROS, mas pode causar 
\f5\i overgeneralization
\f3\i0  e criar exemplos pouco realistas.\
\ls8\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Borderline-SMOTE:
\f3\b0  oversampling apenas nas zonas de fronteira entre classes \'97 
\f2\b ideal para o teu caso
\f3\b0 , j\'e1 que te interessam os 
\f5\i borderline symptoms
\f3\i0 .\
\ls8\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 ADASYN (Adaptive Synthetic Sampling):
\f3\b0  foca-se em exemplos minorit\'e1rios 
\f5\i dif\'edceis de aprender
\f3\i0  (rodeados pela maioria).\uc0\u8232 
\f11 \uc0\u10148 
\f3  Excelente refer\'eancia para sintomas at\'edpicos ou assintom\'e1ticos.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f9 \cf0 \strokec3 \uc0\u55357 \u56481 
\f3  No teu relat\'f3rio podes dizer:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'93Minority examples corresponding to atypical or asymptomatic patients were conceptually treated as 
\f5\i \strokec3 borderline
\f3\i0 \strokec3  or 
\f5\i \strokec3 hard
\f3\i0 \strokec3  instances. In future work, oversampling methods such as Borderline-SMOTE or ADASYN could be applied to balance these clinical patterns.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
